  "/reviews": "<h1 id=\"what-our-guests-say\">What Our Guests Say</h1>\n<p>Featured feedback from 560+ villa dinners, catering events and private chef bookings across Bali — every review dated, located and tied to a real occasion.</p>\n<p><strong>[Primary CTA: Plan Your Own Evening — WhatsApp +62 896-7407-2020]</strong> · <a href=\"/pricing\">Secondary: See Pricing</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"the-numbers-behind-the-reviews\">The Numbers Behind the Reviews</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>4.9 / 5</strong> guest rating</li>\n<li><strong>12,000+</strong> guests served by Adriano and the myCHEF team</li>\n<li><strong>560+</strong> private dinners, celebrations and chef bookings delivered in Bali villas</li>\n<li><strong>98%</strong> of bookings come from repeat guests or referrals — the stat we're proudest of</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"private-dinners\">Private Dinners</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"We booked myCHEF for our first night in Bali and it set the tone for the whole trip. Chef Bayu adjusted the menu for our gluten-free guest without making it feel like a compromise. The snapper, sambal and the way they left the kitchen spotless felt unbelievably polished.\"\n<strong>— Olivia · Private dinner for 8 · Seminyak villa · February 2026</strong></p>\n<p>\"We had grandparents, toddlers and two very fussy eaters, so I expected some friction. Instead the chef paced the courses perfectly, made a separate kids pasta on request and still delivered a dinner that felt elegant for the adults.\"\n<strong>— Theo · Villa dinner for 12 · Nusa Dua family villa · November 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"My wife had no idea what was planned. The team set up the table by the pool, built a four-course menu around her favourite flavours and had a small dessert waiting with a card. She cried in the best way.\"\n<strong>— James · Anniversary dinner for 2 · Sanur beachside villa · July 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"We have stayed in Canggu multiple times and this was genuinely the best meal of any trip. The pasta was handmade, the branzino was perfectly cooked, and the chef worked around two coeliacs and a nut allergy without reducing the ambition of the menu at all. We booked again before we left.\"\n<strong>— Amelia · Private dining for 6 · Canggu pool villa · April 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/private-chef/seminyak\">Book a private chef in Seminyak →</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"weddings\">Weddings</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"We needed a wedding team that could handle sunset timing, dietary notes and a very small villa kitchen. myCHEF made it look effortless. Dinner landed exactly on schedule, the waiters were warm and calm, and our parents are still talking about the lamb and truffle jus.\"\n<strong>— Harper · Wedding dinner for 42 · Clifftop villa, Uluwatu · January 2026</strong></p>\n<p>\"The welcome party was where we actually got to relax because myCHEF handled everything. They coordinated service, cleared glasses quickly and kept the buffet looking fresh all night. Guests thought we had hired a full hotel team.\"\n<strong>— Mila · Wedding welcome party for 65 · Jimbaran garden villa · October 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"Our wedding had 80 guests across multiple nationalities. myCHEF handled welcome canapés, a four-course plated dinner and a late-night grazing station without a single moment of visible chaos.\"\n<strong>— Lucas · Villa wedding for 80 · Seminyak private villa · March 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/events/weddings\">See wedding catering →</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"retreats-corporate\">Retreats &amp; Corporate</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"Our retreat group had vegan, high-protein and no-dairy requests all at the same table. Every meal still felt abundant and beautiful. Adriano's team understood exactly how to keep food nourishing without making it boring.\"\n<strong>— Isla · Wellness retreat for 26 · Ubud · December 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"We booked breakfast, lunch and an evening canape service for our company offsite. Menus changed every day, portions were generous and the communication on timing was excellent.\"\n<strong>— Ethan · Corporate catering for 35 · Berawa · September 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"The closing dinner felt like the emotional finale our retreat needed. Long table, candlelight, beautifully plated food and a service team that read the room perfectly. Guests asked for the WhatsApp number before dessert was finished.\"\n<strong>— Sofia · Yoga retreat closing dinner · Tabanan · August 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/catering/retreat-catering\">See retreat catering →</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"celebrations-bbqs\">Celebrations &amp; BBQs</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"This was supposed to be a relaxed birthday lunch and it ended up feeling like a private resort event. The grazing starters disappeared in minutes, the seafood grill was excellent and the bartender kept everything moving without ever being intrusive.\"\n<strong>— Noah · Birthday BBQ for 18 · Canggu · March 2026</strong></p>\n<p>\"We had a mixed group of Australian and Indonesian families and the catering team put together a menu that bridged both perfectly — Indonesian bites alongside very good mezze and fresh salads. Everything disappeared fast.\"\n<strong>— Charlotte · Baby shower for 20 · Pererenan · June 2025</strong></p>\n<p>\"Our leadership offsite needed meals that energised rather than slowed the group down. The chef built every meal around clean proteins and seasonal vegetables. The team were invisible when they needed to be and attentive when we needed refreshes.\"\n<strong>— William · Corporate retreat for 14 · Ubud · May 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"where-to-verify-us\">Where to Verify Us</h2>\n<p>Third-party review profiles: <strong></strong>. We publish every review here with a date, a location and an occasion so you can judge them the way we'd want to be judged.</p>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<p><strong>Are these real reviews?</strong>\nYes — each review names the occasion, guest count, location and month. We curate which appear here, but every one is from a real booking.</p>\n<p><strong>What is the 98% repeat-or-referred figure?</strong>\nThe share of bookings that come from guests who booked before or were referred by someone who had. It's the number we watch closest.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I read reviews for my specific occasion or area?</strong>\nYes — filter above by occasion (dinners, weddings, retreats, celebrations). Location pages carry their own area reviews, e.g. <a href=\"/private-chef/uluwatu\">Uluwatu</a> and <a href=\"/private-chef/canggu\">Canggu</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I leave a review after my event?</strong>\nYour concierge shares a review link after service. Honest feedback — good or bad — is read by the whole team.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ready-to-create-your-own-story\">Ready to Create Your Own Story?</h2>\n<p>Tell us your villa, date and guest count. We'll match you with the right chef and service style for your dinner, event or retreat.</p>\n<p><strong>[Primary CTA: Chat on WhatsApp — +62 896-7407-2020]</strong>\n<a href=\"/why-mychef\">Secondary CTA: Why Villas Choose myCHEF →</a></p>",
  "/seafood-bbq-catering-bali": "<h1 id=\"seafood-bbq-bali-jimbaran-market-fresh-grilled-live-at-your-villa\">Seafood BBQ Bali — Jimbaran-Market Fresh, Grilled Live at Your Villa</h1>\n<p>Snapper, tiger prawns, squid, and lobster — bought at dawn, grilled over coconut-husk charcoal at your villa by sunset. This is Bali's most iconic way to eat seafood, done properly: Jimbaran-style, at your own poolside.</p>\n<p><strong>From IDR 700,000/person · 8–40 guests · Market sourcing, chef, staff &amp; cleanup included</strong></p>\n<p>[Get My Seafood Quote] · [How It Works]</p>",
