  "/villa-bbq-catering-bali": "<h1 id=\"villa-bbq-catering-bali-private-bbq-parties-at-your-villa\">Villa BBQ Catering Bali — Private BBQ Parties at Your Villa</h1>\n<p>Your villa. Your pool. A private chef working a live grill while your group drifts between the water, the bar, and the table. This is the BBQ party night — packaged, staffed, and cleaned up so the host never leaves the conversation.</p>\n<p><strong>Party packages from IDR 700,000/person · 8–80 guests · Grill, team &amp; cleanup included</strong></p>\n<p>[Get My Party Quote] · [See the Packages]</p>",
